        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>This function returns the signature size in bytes for the given SLH-DSA parameter set. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ParamSet</parametername>
